---
title: Shopping list
---

# Shopping list

:state shopping = [{"item": "Bread", "price": 4.5, "got": false}, {"item": "Milk", "price": 2, "got": true}, {"item": "Coffee", "price": 12, "got": false}]
:state showTotal = false
:state name = "Ada"
:computed title = name + "'s list"
:computed many = count(shopping)

## { title | upper }

- [x] Write the list
- [ ] Go to the shop

@loop shopping into row sort by row.price desc
**{ row.item }**: { row.price | money }

:if row.got
(in the basket)
:else
(still to buy)
:endif
@endloop

:button "Add eggs" -> shopping append {"item": "Eggs", "price": 3, "got": false}
:button "Toggle total" -> showTotal toggle
:button "Empty the list" -> shopping clear

:if showTotal
Total: { shopping | sum:"price" | money } for { many } items.
:else
The total is hidden.
:endif
